---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Prompt from '../components/Prompt.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Justin Kerr and this site.">
  <Prompt cmd="cat about.md" />
  <div class="post-body prose max-w-none">
    <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" class="about-icon" />
    <p>
      I'm Justin Kerr, a site reliability and platform engineer in the Austin, Texas area. I've spent about
      fifteen years keeping production systems running, mostly on AWS, with Terraform, Kubernetes,
      and a lot of Python and Go tools to make the boring parts less painful.
    </p>

    <p>
      This site is a static Astro blog and portfolio, written in Markdown and hosted on GitHub Pages
      for as close to free as I can manage. It's where I write up what I build, what worked, what
      didn't, and what each choice cost in money and maintenance time.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of my "experiments" live on their own subdomains. Each one is a small, playful project, from interactive
      canvases to a WebAssembly game, and each one can choose its own stack and hosting. 
    </p>

    <p>
      The source is on <a href="https://github.com/jbirdkerr/jbirdkerr.github.io">GitHub</a> under
      AGPL-3.0. If something here is useful to you, take it and adapt it. You can also find me on
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/justincraigkerr/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
